## Callback data (límite 64 bytes Telegram)

```
predict_open:{match_num}:{grp8}
predict_save:{match_num}:{score}:{grp8}
predict_ko:{match_num}:{score}:{via}:{winner}:{grp8}
completo_start:{match_num}:{grp8}
scorer_p:{match_num}:{p_idx}:{grp8}
scorer_g:{match_num}:{p_idx}:{goals}:{grp8}
red_card:{match_num}:{bool}:{grp8}
mvp_p:{match_num}:{p_idx}:{grp8}
change_group:{grp8}
```

`grp8` = primeros 8 chars del group UUID. La Lambda resuelve el UUID completo.
`p_idx` = índice en la lista de jugadores sugeridos (no el nombre — evita overflow).

